{"id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-typed-conservative.md","title":"TB对PA的算术保守性","display":"thm-typed-conservative — TB对PA的算术保守性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-typed-conservative","aliases":["91-thm-typed-conservative"],"display":"thm-typed-conservative — TB对PA的算术保守性","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","[[91-df-conservativity-proof]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-typed-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-typed-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-typed-conservative — TB对PA的算术保守性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"23ed499f8d7c6524\" href=\"?note=23ed499f8d7c6524\" title=\"91-df-conservativity-proof\">91-df-conservativity-proof</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-typed-conservative-—-TB-对-PA-的算术保守性\">thm-typed-conservative — TB 对 PA 的算术保守性</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano 算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB}\\)</span> (PA 上的基础闭句去引号理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言句子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>\n(基础语言保守性, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}typed\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}typed\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>即</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于 PA 与 TB 均按定义取演绎闭包，等价地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n=\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TB}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n=\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>，可在元理论中选择\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq M\">\\(T^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq M\\)</span>，使每个基础语言句子\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的标准编码满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal M,T^{\\mathcal M})\\models\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathcal M,T^{\\mathcal M})\\models\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此每个 PA 模型都有 TB 扩张。若一个基础语言句子不被 PA 证明，\n由完备性取其否定的 PA 模型，再作上述扩张，便知它也不被 TB 证明。</p>\n<p>结论只针对这里精确定义的 TB。不能从“有类型”这一句法特征推出任意\n带归纳、反射或额外真理公理的类型化理论都保守。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-typed-conservative-—-TB-对-PA-的算术保守性","text":"thm-typed-conservative — TB 对 PA 的算术保守性","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservativity-proof","status":"resolved","id":"23ed499f8d7c6524","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservativity-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TB}$ (PA 上的基础闭句去引号理论, see [[91-df-TB]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})$\n(基础语言保守性, see [[91-df-conservative-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}typed\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{PA}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n=\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\models\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal M,T^{\\mathcal M})\\models\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\sigma\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\\sigma.","display":true}],"bytes":1738,"backlinks":[{"id":"aa2ad816ed17d60f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"37a053154986e417","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"说明：TB是在 PA 上加入基础语言 T-schema 的经典演绎闭包；模式只应用于\n不含真理谓词的基础语言句子。标准的 TB 对 PA 是保守扩张\n（见[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]），但这个结论是模型扩张定理，\n不是定义本身的一部分。"},{"id":"8ed8a780d077dd76","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","4a1d989a5f615933","23ed499f8d7c6524"]}